{"ticker":"HAS","updated":"2026-10-23T23:03:42Z","profile":{"longName":"Hasbro, Inc.","shortName":"Hasbro, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Leisure","country":"United States","website":"https://corporate.hasbro.com","fullTimeEmployees":4520,"marketCap":16564261888,"trailingPE":21.008944,"forwardPE":17.24434,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.1971166,"pegRatio":2.08,"targetMeanPrice":117.76923,"targetHighPrice":137.0,"targetLowPrice":100.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.15,"earningsGrowth":0.689,"grossMargins":0.65345,"operatingMargins":0.32426998,"profitMargins":0.1844,"totalRevenue":5181000192,"beta":0.441,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":117.77,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":74.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.39},"summary":"Hasbro, Inc. operates as a toy and game company in the United States, Europe, Canada, Mexico, Latin America, Australia, China, and Hong Kong. The company offers trading cards and collectibles, action figures, arts and crafts and creative play products, dolls, play sets, preschool toys, plush products, vehicles and toy-related specialty products, sports action products and accessories, and other consumer products; and licensed products, such as apparel, publishing products, home goods and electronics, and toy products. It also engages in the sourcing, marketing, and sale of toy and game products; and promotes its brands through the out-licensing of trademarks, characters, and other brand and intellectual property rights to third parties through the sale of branded consumer products, such as toys and apparel. In addition, the company is involved in the promotion of its brands through the development of trading cards, role-playing, and digital game experiences based on Hasbro and Wizards of the Coast games; and license certain brands to other third-party digital game developers who transform Hasbro brand-based characters and other intellectual properties, into digital gaming experiences. Further, it develops and produces of Hasbro-branded entertainment content, including film, television, children's programming, digital content, and live entertainment. The company sells its produc","summary_zh":"Hasbro, Inc. 是一家玩具和遊戲公司，業務遍及美國、歐洲、加拿大、墨西哥、拉丁美洲、澳洲、中國和香港。該公司提供交易卡和收藏品、人偶、工藝品和創意玩具產品、玩偶、玩具套裝、學前玩具、毛絨產品、車輛和玩具相關特色產品、運動動作產品和配件以及其他消費品；以及特許產品，例如服裝、出版產品、家居用品和電子產品以及玩具產品。它還從事玩具和遊戲產品的採購、行銷和銷售；透過銷售玩具和服裝等品牌消費品，將商標、角色和其他品牌和智慧財產權授權給第三方，從而推廣其品牌。此外，該公司還透過開發集換式卡牌、角色扮演以及基於 Hasbro 和 Wizards of the Coast 遊戲的數位遊戲體驗來推廣其品牌；並將某些品牌授權給其他第三方數位遊戲開發商，這些開發商將孩之寶基於品牌的角色和其他智慧財產權轉化為數位遊戲體驗。此外，它還開發和製作孩之寶品牌的娛樂內容，包括電影、電視、兒童節目、數位內容和現場娛樂。該公司銷售其產品","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"閒暇","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":81.43,"h":81.69,"l":80.88,"c":81.06,"v":857900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":81.09,"h":81.84,"l":80.74,"c":81.6,"v":2283200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":81.53,"h":82.19,"l":81.19,"c":81.56,"v":1021200},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":81.56,"h":81.72,"l":80.86,"c":81.6,"v":1119300},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":81.47,"h":82.01,"l":80.57,"c":81.17,"v":991100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":79.9,"h":80.6,"l":79.19,"c":79.75,"v":1598000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":79.67,"h":80.5,"l":78.98,"c":79.03,"v":1606400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":79.37,"h":80.44,"l":78.78,"c":80.4,"v":1226400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":80.62,"h":81.28,"l":79.29,"c":79.73,"v":1362100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":79.79,"h":79.79,"l":78.4,"c":79.36,"v":1444800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":79.16,"h":79.16,"l":78.12,"c":78.64,"v":1143700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":78.36,"h":78.56,"l":77.13,"c":77.66,"v":1183900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":77.71,"h":80.11,"l":77.71,"c":79.95,"v":2008600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":79.5,"h":79.85,"l":78.36,"c":78.38,"v":1147500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":78.61,"h":78.61,"l":75.96,"c":76.0,"v":2104200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":76.16,"h":76.35,"l":74.1,"c":74.69,"v":2033600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":75.1,"h":75.85,"l":73.74,"c":73.92,"v":1589000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":74.44,"h":75.18,"l":73.77,"c":74.88,"v":1317900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":74.65,"h":74.74,"l"